# Figures ARE tracked: checkpoints are not committed, so they are not in fact
# regenerable from a fresh clone, and they are the visible evidence for the
# write-up. 15.6 MB total, largest file 3.15 MB.

# Tracked on purpose (small, needed to reproduce/verify results):
#   outputs/metrics.csv, outputs/summary_seeds.csv, outputs/history_*.csv,
#   outputs/gradcam_analysis_*.json, outputs/ood_rejection.json,
#   outputs/preprocess_stats.json
# The class subset is defined in src/classes.py, so nothing under data/ needs tracking;
# data/ (raw, processed, and the OOD probe set) is all re-fetchable.
